---
<section class="guarantee">
  <div class="guarantee-inner">
    <h2 class="guarantee-h2">
      If I can't show you <em>at least 5 hours a week</em> of AI leverage on the call,
      I'll send you <span class="dollar">$50</span>.
    </h2>

    <p class="guarantee-sub">Amazon gift card, Venmo, whatever you want.</p>
    <p class="guarantee-fineprint">No fine print.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guarantee {
    background: #0A0A0A;
    color: #fff;
    padding: clamp(140px, 22vh, 260px) 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .guarantee-inner {
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .guarantee-h2 {
    font-family: "Geist", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5.2vw, 84px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin: 0;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .guarantee-h2 em {
    font-family: "Geist", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .dollar {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }
  .guarantee-sub {
    font-family: "Geist", system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 1.4vw, 21px);
    color: #aaa;
    margin-top: clamp(36px, 5vh, 56px);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .guarantee-fineprint {
    font-family: "Geist Mono", ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #555;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
</style>
